WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Creating tasks. The New task dialog: a title is all you need; everything else is optional.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: fast capture; structured request.

3
00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.780
Choose New task.

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.250
Only the title is required. Create task stays off until there is one.

5
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.970
Type a title…

6
00:00:15.970 --> 00:00:17.710
…and create it.

7
00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:21.530
The new task is in the list and open in the drawer, ready for more detail.

8
00:00:21.530 --> 00:00:27.530
Create task is disabled: Type a title (spaces alone don't count), and wait for the form to finish loading. “You do not have permission to create tasks here.”: You're a Viewer in this workspace.

9
00:00:27.530 --> 00:00:32.030
Only the title is required
